  str_draw_card_pool_title_40003_2 = "After recruiting 10 times, the Special Christmas Recruitment will be closed!",
  str_draw_card_pool_detail_title_40003 = "Reglas de reclutamiento",
  str_draw_card_pool_detail_sub_desc40003_1 = "This is a special Christmas recruitment. You need to buy the specified 10× Special Recruitment Spirit item from the store to take part. Use the specified 10× Special Recruitment Spirit item to recruit 10 times in a row. Once you use this item, the Special Christmas Recruitment will be closed.\n\nTake part in this recruitment, and you're guaranteed to get at least one 6-Star Aurorian (<color=#ffbb00>Carleen, Uriel, Migard, or Irridon</color>). The probability of obtaining characters of different ratings in the remaining 9 recruitment draws will be the same as the probability of a normal recruitment. Meaning you might have a chance of obtaining more Aurorians de 6 Estrellas in addition to one of the aforementioned Aurorians de 6 Estrellas. See the table below for specific Aurorians and recruitment rates.\n\nPlease note that the Special Christmas Recruitment is a limited-time recruitment pool, therefore, it is recommended that you complete this special recruitment before the end of the special recruitment period.\n\nIf you purchased the 10× Special Recruitment Spirit item but fail to take part in the special recruitment event, your 10× Special Recruitment Spirit will be converted into 3,000 Lumamber after the special recruitment period ends. The Lumamber will be sent directly to your in-game mailbox.",
